1.4.14 headless facts verified on the Mac (default approval and sandbox,
--max-model-steps, the --json events), the cost estimate and the real
bisect → timelines → pick run. HACKATHON.md marks Muse Code timelines and
Wonder planning live; AGENTS.md, the CHANGELOG and STATUS.md are updated
(Next: timelines part 2, Wonder judging and demo integration).

